1290
01:07:00,642 --> 01:07:02,018
- Where'd you get these calls?
- Uh...

1291
01:07:02,101 --> 01:07:05,772
My mom's cloud.
Can you tell if they're fake or not?

1292
01:07:05,855 --> 01:07:07,148
- If it's a fake, it's a good one.
- Hmm.

1293
01:07:07,232 --> 01:07:09,192
The shadows are consistent.

1294
01:07:09,275 --> 01:07:12,612
The eyes, hands, they all have
zero artifacts or pixilation. I mean...

1295
01:07:12,695 --> 01:07:14,113
These might have been live calls.

1296
01:07:14,197 --> 01:07:17,075
All right, well, if it is Stu Macher

1297
01:07:17,158 --> 01:07:19,327
then we know he has an accomplice.

1298
01:07:19,410 --> 01:07:21,621
He can't be in two places at once, so...

1299
01:07:23,289 --> 01:07:24,582
who is it?

1300
