Why would any of us want to
terrorize Tatum and her mom?

1301
01:07:26,918 --> 01:07:30,255
Why indeed. Let's talk motive.

1302
01:07:30,338 --> 01:07:31,798
Pardon. Thank you.

1303
01:07:31,881 --> 01:07:34,509
- Okay, Ben.
- Mmm.

1304
01:07:34,592 --> 01:07:37,220
Does Sidney truly approve
of you as Tatum's boyfriend?

1305
01:07:37,303 --> 01:07:40,932
Moms never like the boyfriend.
That's Mommy 101, there.

1306
01:07:41,015 --> 01:07:44,102
And you're an interesting mix
of brawn and brains.

1307
01:07:44,185 --> 01:07:46,688
Nah. I like to work out
my body and my mind, yeah.

1308
01:07:46,771 --> 01:07:48,565
See, that's incredibly bizarre
to say out loud.

1309
01:07:48,648 --> 01:07:50,358
[Mindy] Chloe.

1310
01:07:50,441 --> 01:07:52,277
- Hey.
- [Mindy] Fun-loving. Everyone likes.

1311
01:07:52,360 --> 01:07:54,779
Excellent hair. Seemingly has no motive.

1312
01:07:54,862 --> 01:07:56,239
That's me.

1313
01:07:56,322 --> 01:07:57,657
- I'm not buying it.
- [Chloe] Good.

1314
01:07:57,740 --> 01:07:59,242
I don't like a girl that everyone likes.

1315
01:07:59,325 --> 01:08:00,827
It's boring.

1316
01:08:00,910 --> 01:08:03,329
Oh. See? That's motive.

1317
01:08:03,413 --> 01:08:06,165
Right? Boredom?
Now we're in Stu Macher territory.

1318
01:08:06,249 --> 01:08:08,042
- [Mindy] And you, weird boy.
- Okay.

1319
01:08:08,126 --> 01:08:12,046
You've displayed an unsettling obsession
with all things Sidney Prescott.

1320
01:08:12,130 --> 01:08:14,048
She's a pinnacle
in the true-crime lexicon.

1321
01:08:14,132 --> 01:08:15,633
