1323
01:08:18,803 --> 01:08:21,306
Splitting hairs, young man.

1324
01:08:21,389 --> 01:08:22,849
Okay, my money's on boyfriend.

1325
01:08:22,932 --> 01:08:24,267
Yeah, my bet's on creepy kid.

1326
