1359
01:09:40,093 --> 01:09:41,094
Oh.

1360
01:09:44,138 --> 01:09:46,724
<i>- Welcome, Sidney. Hi.
- Hi, Gale.</i>

1361
01:09:46,808 --> 01:09:51,187
<i>So everyone knows you as
