1426
01:13:07,008 --> 01:13:09,969
<i>This has been a Robbie Rivers
exclusive with Gale Weathers</i>

1427
01:13:10,052 --> 01:13:12,722
<i>and Pine Grove's very own
Sidney Prescott Evans.</i>

1428
